ynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊子贞会试四首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"传经弟子尔超群，落笔曾惊五色文。\n春日甘泉新奏赋，子虚谁道独淩云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6325,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊子贞会试四首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"结束轻装紫玉骝，雪中嘶入汉长楸。\n五陵宾客能相荐，曾是河南第一流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6326,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊子贞会试四首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"吴公今引贾生来，意气千秋亦壮哉。\n此日殿前亲策士，洛阳宁少治安才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6327,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊子贞会试四首 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"如云词客满公车，君入承明侍从庐。\n若见长安鸿雁过，玉河西畔好题书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6328,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日出郊登五龙台过鄢家庄看花六首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"晴光飞洒五龙台，少室三花向此开。\n不是仙人谁敢过，彩云深拥玉鞍来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6329,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日出郊登五龙台过鄢家庄看花六首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"淮河西下绕城斜，马上相逢问酒家。\n郢客何来歌白雪，千门春色尽杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6330,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日出郊