任","text":"谭诗匡鼎解人颐，岂似朱游折角时。\n三泖烟中吹笛去，流波空讯十年期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6337,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈恩甫见邀同吴虎臣饮八首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"秋色山山照酒杯，满天鸿雁过淮来。\n谁知万里思归客，半醉西风戏马台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6338,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈恩甫见邀同吴虎臣饮八首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"作客黄亭近楚天，参军谁似孟嘉贤。\n武昌西望龙山宴，多少风流落帽边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6339,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈恩甫见邀同吴虎臣饮八首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"高斋宾客未全贫，杯为黄花送百巡。\n毋论积薪犹不调，十年持戟是何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6340,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈恩甫见邀同吴虎臣饮八首 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"总为风尘作吏慵，宁能五斗负千峰。\n爱君今日东篱下，还著将归邴曼容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6341,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈恩甫见邀同吴虎臣饮八首 其五","author":"欧大任","text":"楚客柴桑处士风，他乡共醉菊园中。\n小儿已舁蓝舆待，莫惜千觞劝醉翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6342,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日王九德崔继甫沈